From 37705f5b8641de6463f95542cf03be15841c3f0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 09:14:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: tarik artikel Medium (@0wlsky) otomatis via RSS, sama
 seperti X Articles

- tools/sync-medium-articles.py: fetch RSS resmi Medium, tulis medium-articles.json
  (full content:encoded, cover, tags, excerpt). Merge-aware, jadi story lama tidak
  hilang saat Medium menggeser feed.
- .github/workflows/sync-medium-articles.yml: cron tiap ~2 jam + workflow_dispatch,
  commit otomatis kalau ada perubahan (pola sama seperti sync-x-articles.yml).
- medium-articles.json: seed kosong, diisi otomatis oleh workflow di atas.
- script.js: loader + cache + convertMediumHtmlToBlocks (DOMParser: paragraf,
  heading, quote, list, image, video, link) + merge ke state.data.articles,
  kategori 'medium-articles', rail 'From Medium' di homepage, badge sumber di
  dispatch grid, kotak sumber + tombol 'Baca di Medium' di article.html, guard
  edit/delete untuk artikel import (X & Medium).
- index.html: section #mediumArticlesSection (rail) setelah section X Articles.
- style.css: aksen border .dispatch-card.from-medium.
- tools/validate.sh: validasi medium-articles.json juga.
